WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:02.194
Matrix multiplication, settled?

2
00:00:02.800 --> 00:00:05.621
The upper bound fell to nine over four in

3
00:00:05.621 --> 00:00:08.129
October. This paper claims nothing lower is possible.

4
00:00:09.100 --> 00:00:11.299
A faster method would compress networks so

5
00:00:11.299 --> 00:00:13.183
far that a counting bound breaks.

6
